# Template HOME for the E2E suite. `make e2e-login` points a real `claude` at
# this directory, so it receives OAuth credentials, an account id and session
# history. Only the fixtures the suite needs are tracked; everything else,
# including anything a future Claude Code version writes here, stays out.
*
!.gitignore
!settings.json
!plugins/
plugins/*
!plugins/installed_plugins.json
!plugins/known_marketplaces.json
!plugins/cache/
!plugins/cache/.keep
